OL,3,GNEWSAGroup awarded licence to run
OL,4,Atourist board
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of industry leaders has been
OL,7,Flicensed to run Cornwall's official
OL,8,Ftourism board.
OL,10,FThe independent, not-for-profit
OL,11,FCornwall Visitor Alliance has secured a
OL,12,Flicence agreement with the council to
OL,13,Foperate Visit Cornwall.
OL,15,FVisit Cornwall went into liquidation
OL,16,Flast October due to what a spokesperson
OL,17,Fcalled "insurmountable financial
OL,18,Fproblems".
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
